			"notes": "Hopefully it's not as much of a disaster as 1.3.0.\n\n### Changes\n\n* **Dynamic Block Entity Support!** Currently implemented:\n  \n  * Bell\n  * Chest\n  * Enchantment Table (book)\n  * Shulker Box\n  * Skull\n\n* **Animated texture interpolation shader** - This should make blocks like Prismarine look much better.\n\n* Added warning for known-incompatible mods during export\n\n* Optimized exporter to only remesh adjacent blocks when culling has changed\n\n* Fixed entity root rotations being imported improperly in Blender\n\n* Added mod list to exported replay files for debugging (should not affect importer semantics)"
		},
